Fixed the `Invalid load 'redux_localstorage_simple_blocksClipboard.cut'` and `Invalid load 'redux_localstorage_simple_blocksClipboard.copy'` console warnings shown when nothing is stored in `localStorage` yet. The states listed in `config.settings.persistentReducers` are now saved to `localStorage` only when they change, instead of after every Redux action. Also fixed the blocks clipboard sync between browser tabs, which read a key that is never written instead of the ones configured in `persistentReducers`. @wesleybl
